<div class="ar-dialog" id="archiveSourceManageModal" hidden>
    <div class="ar-dialog-backdrop" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="ar-dialog-panel ar-source-admin-panel" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="archiveSourceManageLabel">
        <div class="ar-dialog-head">
            <h2 id="archiveSourceManageLabel">출처 관리</h2>
            <button type="button" class="ar-dialog-close" data-source-admin-close aria-label="닫기">×</button>
        </div>
        <div class="ar-source-admin-body">
            <p class="ar-source-admin-hint">탭에 보이는 출처를 추가·수정하거나, 쓰지 않는 출처는 숨기거나 삭제할 수 있습니다. 사용 중인 출처는 삭제할 수 없습니다.</p>
            <ul class="ar-source-admin-list" id="archiveSourceAdminList"></ul>
            <form class="ar-source-admin-form" id="archiveSourceAdminForm" novalidate>
                <input type="hidden" name="id" value="">
                <div class="ar-source-admin-fields">
                    <label class="ar-field">코드
                        <input type="text" name="code" maxlength="32" placeholder="예: FAN_MEET" autocomplete="off" required>
                    </label>
                    <label class="ar-field">이름
                        <input type="text" name="label" maxlength="64" placeholder="표시 이름" required>
                    </label>
                    <label class="ar-field">색
                        <input type="color" name="color" value="#00f5d4" aria-label="배지 색">
                    </label>
                    <label class="ar-field">순서
                        <input type="number" name="sortOrder" min="0" step="1" placeholder="자동">
                    </label>
                    <label class="ar-field ar-source-admin-visible">
                        <input type="checkbox" name="visible" checked>
                        탭에 표시
                    </label>
                </div>
                <p class="ar-source-admin-error" id="archiveSourceAdminError" hidden></p>
                <div class="ar-source-admin-actions">
                    <button type="button" class="site-btn site-btn--ghost site-btn--sm" data-source-admin-reset>새로 추가</button>
                    <button type="submit" class="site-btn site-btn--primary site-btn--sm" id="archiveSourceAdminSave">저장</button>
                </div>
            </form>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
